    <aside class="emcard" aria-label="Emergency steps" style="margin-top:14px;box-shadow:none;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);color:#fff">
      <div class="head">Water where it shouldn’t be?</div>
      <div class="bodyc">
        <ol>
          <li><span><b>Shut off the main valve</b> — usually by the meter, basement front wall.</span></li>
          <li><span><b>Keep power away</b> from standing water.</span></li>
          <li><span><b>Call us.</b> For active water, calling is faster than any form.</span></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </aside>
